    "metaDescription": "Eine weitere WordPress-Website",
    "body": "## BUNDLING, PROTECTION, MARKING AND IDENTIFICATION OF CABLES\n\nSince its formation, BIT has been a strong and reliable partner for numerous automotive suppliers. We look back on almost 25 years of experience in the automotive business.\n\nAs such, we supply our customers with high-quality products for cable harness and loom assembly, cable protection, electrical insulation, thermal shielding, or for protection of sensitive components and power mains. Most of our products conform to worldwide industry standards, specifications and test methods.\n\nOf course, we can also work together with you to implement bespoke solutions tailored to your company’s specific individual needs and requirements.\n\nPartner up with BIT and hit the high road!\n\nPARTS OFTEN USED IN AUTOMOTIVE APPLICATIONS\n\nBPBK\n\nPolyolefin\n\nflame-retardant, adhesive-lined, practically non-flammable, UL-certified\n\nIts thermoplastic adhesive inner lining allows BPBK to seal cable connections and harnesses tightly.\n\n| Shrinking Rate: | 4:1\n\n| Certification: | UL 224 (black only)\n\n| Temperature Range Min.: | -40 °C\n\n| Temperature Range Max.: | 125 °C\n\n### Elastomer\n\nmedium wall thickness, practically non-flammable, self-extinguishing\n\nBER 100 provides excellent protection from diesel, hydraulic fluids, and from many other chemicals.\n\n| Shrinking Rate: | 2:1\n\n| Temperature Range Min.: | -55 °C\n\n| Temperature Range Max.: | +150 °C\n\n### Soft PVC\n\nself-extinguishing, temperature-resistant\n\nFlexible heat-stabilized insulating sleeve with white identification stripe.\n\n| Temperature Range Min.: | -40 °C\n\n| Temperature Range Max.: | 105 °C\n\n### PA 6.6\n\nhalogen-free, high temperature resistance, self-extinguishing\n\nBIS GE PA is flexible, self-extinguishing expandable braided sleeving that is easy to install.\n\n| Temperature Range Min.: | -40 °C\n\n| Temperature Range Max.: | 180 °C",
