    "slug": "industrial-sectors/safety-equipment-and-engineering",
    "title": "Products for Safety Equipment and Engineering",
    "metaTitle": "Products for Safety Equipment and Engineering",
    "metaDescription": "Eine weitere WordPress-Website",
    "body": "## GET A SAFE HANDLE WITH SHRINK TUBING FROM BIT\n\nBIT is your competent partner for safety gear and equipment – an area where demands on quality and reliability are often particularly high. Let our sales and service team help you find the perfect solution for your application!\n\nParticularly popular products in safety engineering are our medium-wall and thick-wall heat-shrink tubes (both available with adhesive lining upon request). Such tubing guarantees a safe hold and superior grip on a large number of different surfaces. Our customers use our parts to manufacture or assemble steel cables, hoists and other load-securing setups, PPE items, playground installations, or wire, fiber and synthetic ropes – to name just a few areas of application.\n\nThere is safety in trusting more than 20 years of professional experience and know-how at BIT!\n\nPARTS OFTEN USED FOR SAFETY EQUIPMENT\n\nBP 105\n\nPolyolefin\n\nthin-wall, flexible, halogen-free\n\nFlexible tubing ideal for shrinking around cords, ropes, tags and labels.\n\n| Shrinking Rate: | 2:1\n\n| Temperature Range Min.: | -55 °C\n\n| Temperature Range Max.: | 105 °C\n\n### Polyolefin\n\nheavy-wall/thick-wall, high shrink ratio, adhesive-lined\n\nPerfect abrasion resistance for components with widely varying diameters (shrink ratio 6:1).\n\n| Shrinking Rate: | 6:1\n\n| Temperature Range Min.: | -55 °C\n\n| Temperature Range Max.: | 110 °C\n\n### PTFE\n\nanti-adhesive, thin-wall, high chemical resistance, high temperature resistance, very high shrink ratio, non-flammable\n\nPTFE 400 excels through its great thermal resistance and high shrink ratio.\n\n| Shrinking Rate: | 4:1\n\n| Temperature Range Min.: | -67 °C\n\n| Temperature Range Max.: | +260 °C\n\n### VMQ\n\nhalogen-free, high temperature resistance, highly flexible\n\nBIS SI is usually employed as a highly flexible, temperature-resistant protective sleeve.\n\n| Temperature Range Min.: | -60 °C\n\n| Temperature Range Max.: | 200 °C\n\n### AISI 304 or AISI 316 stainless steel\n\nstainless steel cable ties, high chemical resistance, high temperature resistance\n\nGTME ties are corrosion-resistant and perfect for use under extreme conditions.\n\n| Temperature Range Min.: | -80 °C\n\n| Temperature Range Max.: | +500 °C",
    "source": "/en/industrial-sectors/safety-equipment-and-engineering/"
