    "body": "## Legal notice\n\n### Online dispute resolution\n\nBesides standard legal recourse through the courts, the European Commission alternatively provides for dispute mediation, resolution and settlement out of court, pursuant to Regulation (EU) No. 524/2013, through its online platform at https://ec.europa.eu/consumers/odr. Our main e-mail address is info@bit-gmbh.de. However, in direct reference to Section 36 of the German Act on Alternative Dispute Resolution in Consumer Matters (VSBG or Verbraucherstreitbeilegungsgesetz), we hereby point out that we are in no way obligated to settle a dispute in such out-of-court proceedings.\n\n© Photography:\n\nRheinfoto, Maren Richter\n\n© Icons:\n\n- Birckhead Creative, Letter, CC BY 3.0\n\n- Birckhead Creative, Download, CC BY 3.0\n\n- Birckhead Creative, female business casual headset, CC BY 3.0\n\n- Birckhead Creative, global solutions, CC BY 3.0\n\n- Birckhead Creative, Target , CC BY 3.0\n\n- Birckhead Creative, Checklist, CC BY 3.0\n\n- Birckhead Creative, Award, CC BY 3.0\n\n- Birckhead Creative, financial growth, CC BY 3.0\n\n- Birckhead Creative, Notebook, CC BY 3.0\n\n- Birckhead Creative, direction, CC BY 3.0\n\n- Birckhead Creative, professional development, CC BY 3.0\n\n- Birckhead Creative, balance, CC BY 3.0\n\n- Birckhead Creative, Problem Solving, CC BY 3.0\n\n© Programming & Design:\n\nwebpages Klein GmbH & Co. KG\n\nHosting/EDV:\n\nExtrusia GmbH",
