    "metaTitle": "SHRINK TUBING TRANSPARENT / CLEAR",
    "metaDescription": "Eine weitere WordPress-Website",
    "body": "## SHRINK TUBING IN TRANSPARENT / CRYSTAL CLEAR VERSION\n\nProtection of labels and markings\n\nOften cables, wires or even ropes have to be provided with labels. To protect the labels, shrink tubing in transparent or crystal-clear design is a simple, safe and cost-effective solution.\n\nThe labels are thus protected from mechanical stress and environmental influences and remain legible for longer.\n\nAnother advantage of transparent shrink tubing is the ability to perform visual inspections of the component or shrink-wrapped connections without having to remove the shrink tubing.\n\nTransparent shrink tubing is available in various materials, such as polyolefin, PTFE, FEP or PVDF. Depending on the plastic used, shrink ratios of up to 4:1 can be offered.\n\nContact us – we are sure to have the right shrink tubing for your application.\n\nHere you will find all our heat shrinkable tubing.\n\nIn addition to heat shrinkable tubing, we also carry insulating tubing in transparent versions. You can find our insulating hoses here.\n\nRecommended clear heat shrinkable tubing\n\nBP 105\n\nPolyolefin\n\nflexible, halogen-free, thin-wall\n\nFlexible tubing ideal for shrinking around cords, ropes, tags and labels.\n\n| Shrinking Rate: | 2:1\n\n| Temperature Range Min.: | -55 °C\n\n| Temperature Range Max.: | 105 °C\n\n### PTFE\n\nanti-adhesive, high chemical resistance, high temperature resistance, non-flammable, thin-wall, very high shrink ratio\n\nPTFE 400 excels through its great thermal resistance and high shrink ratio.\n\n| Shrinking Rate: | 4:1\n\n| Temperature Range Min.: | -67 °C\n\n| Temperature Range Max.: | +260 °C\n\n### Polyolefin\n\nflame-retardant, high shrink ratio, thin-wall, UL-certified\n\nDue to its improved shrink ratio, BP 300 can easily shrink around components that vary in size.\n\n| Shrinking Rate: | 3:1\n\n| Certification: | UL 224 (except clear-colored)\n\n| Temperature Range Min.: | -55 °C\n\n| Temperature Range Max.: | 135 °C\n\n### PVDF (KYNAR®)\n\npractically non-flammable, self-extinguishing, thin-wall, UL-certified, UV-resistant\n\nPerfect for applications that require both high mechanical and thermal resistance.\n\n| Shrinking Rate: | 2:1\n\n| Certification: | UL 224, 125°C, VW-1, 600V\n\n| Temperature Range Min.: | -55 °C\n\n| Temperature Range Max.: | +175 °C",
    "source": "/en/shrink-tubing-transparent-clear/"
